<title>USA: AGCO Corp Q3 shr drops with charge.</title>
<headline>AGCO Corp Q3 shr drops with charge.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.54		    $0.77</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.54		     0.65</p>
<p> Net			 31,299		   36,195</p>
<p> Sales		    588,859		  484,228</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	57,572		   47,086</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	57,598		   56,944</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.58		    $2.06</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 1.51		     1.71</p>
<p> Net			 85,899		   95,467</p>
<p> Sales		  1,627,424		1,486,358</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	54,374		   45,354</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	57,341		   56,440</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q3 1996 includes non-recurring expenses of $6.2 million, or $0.07 per share, related to restructuring of its European operations. For the first nine months of 1996, the charge for the same expenses was $12.9 million, or $0.15 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
